# Template module requests. They go through the gateway: start everything with the AppHost and the template enabled
#   dotnet run --project backend/src/AppHost/Flowgent.AppHost -- --AppHost:Modules:template:Enabled=true

@HostAddress = http://localhost:5080

### Module summary (routed to the template service)

GET {{HostAddress}}/api/modules/template

### Start a run of the template-hello workflow

POST {{HostAddress}}/api/engine/workflows/template-hello/runs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Flowgent runs workflows described in YAML. Each module publishes its definitions and tools, and the engine runs them."
}

### Runs of the template workflow

GET {{HostAddress}}/api/engine/runs?workflowId=template-hello
